{"sha": "d8d69ea373f8987e78cc4b588590e7a0a91a725e15dee13a82e8f15ea65f440b", "body": ["\\section{基本线性电路}", "", "\\begin{method}[线性区中理想运算放大器电路的分析]\\label{met:b1:operational-amplifier:method}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 检查反馈是否接到反相输入端。", "  \\item 令 $i_+ = i_- = 0$：输入节点服从基尔霍夫节点定律，", "        即流入放大器的电流为零（分压与米尔曼", "        定理均适用）。", "  \\item 令 $V_+ = V_-$，解出 $V_s$。", "  \\item 事后检验 $\\abs{V_s} < V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$ 是否成立，若不成立，", "        则放大器已饱和，结果为 $\\pm V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[跟随器、同相放大器与反相放大器]\\label{prop:b1:operational-amplifier:basic}", "\\index{电压跟随器}\\index{同相放大器}\\index{反相放大器}\\index{虚地}", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{跟随器}：输出端接 $V_-$，输入端接在 $V_+$ 上：", "        $V_s = V_e$；输入阻抗无穷大，输出阻抗为零。", "  \\item \\emph{同相放大器}：输出端接 $V_-$，经", "        由 $R_2$（反馈）与 $R_1$（接地）构成的分压器，输入接在 $V_+$ 上：", "        \\[", "        V_s = \\left(1 + \\frac{R_2}{R_1}\\right)V_e .", "        \\]", "  \\item \\emph{反相放大器}：$V_+$ 接地，输入信号经", "        $R_1$ 接到 $V_-$，反馈电阻 $R_2$ 从输出端接回 $V_-$：", "        \\[", "        V_s = -\\frac{R_2}{R_1}\\,V_e ,", "        \\]", "        此时 $V_-$ 保持地电势（称为\\emph{虚地}），", "        输入阻抗为 $R_1$。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "跟随器：$V_- = V_s$，$V_+ = V_e$；由 $\\epsilon = 0$ 得 $V_s = V_e$。", "同相放大器：$V_-$ 处无电流流入，故由分压关系得 $V_- =", "V_sR_1/(R_1 + R_2)$，令其等于 $V_+ = V_e$。反相放大器：$V_- = V_+ = 0$；", "在 $V_-$ 处列节点方程（取 $i_- = 0$）：$(V_e - 0)/R_1 + (V_s - 0)/R_2 = 0$。", "信号源提供的电流为 $V_e/R_1$，输入阻抗为 $R_1$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % follower (+ input up)", "  \\node[op amp, noinv input up] (a) at (0,0) {};", "  \\draw (a.+) -- ++(-0.6,0) node[left] {$V_e$};", "  \\draw (a.out) -- ++(0.5,0) node[right] {$V_s$};", "  \\draw (a.out) ++(0.25,0) -- ++(0,-1.3) -| ($(a.-)+(-0.4,0)$) -- (a.-);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.7) {跟随器：$V_s = V_e$};", "  % non-inverting (+ input up)", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=5.6cm]", "  \\node[op amp, noinv input up] (b) at (0,0) {};", "  \\draw (b.+) -- ++(-0.8,0) node[left] {$V_e$};", "  \\draw (b.out) -- ++(0.6,0) node[right] {$V_s$};", "  \\coordinate (j) at ($(b.-)+(-0.5,0)$);", "  \\draw (b.-) -- (j);", "  \\coordinate (f) at ($(j)+(0,-1.0)$);", "  \\coordinate (o) at ($(b.out)+(0.3,0)$);", "  \\draw (o) -- (o |- f) to[R=$R_2$] (f) -- (j);", "  \\draw (f) to[R=$R_1$] ++(0,-1.6) node[ground]{};", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-3.7) {同相放大器：$V_s = (1 + R_2/R_1)V_e$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % inverting (- input up)", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.3cm]", "  \\node[op amp] (c) at (0,0) {};", "  \\draw (c.+) -- ++(-0.4,0) node[ground]{};", "  \\coordinate (m) at ($(c.-)+(-0.5,0)$);", "  \\draw (c.-) -- (m) to[R=$R_1$] ++(-1.5,0) node[left] {$V_e$};", "  \\draw (c.out) -- ++(0.6,0) node[right] {$V_s$};", "  \\coordinate (f2) at ($(m)+(0,1.3)$);", "  \\coordinate (o2) at ($(c.out)+(0.3,0)$);", "  \\draw (o2) -- (o2 |- f2) to[R=$R_2$] (f2) -- (m);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.7) {反相放大器：$V_s = -(R_2/R_1)V_e$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三种基本放大器。在每一种中，输出端都接回", "反相输入端，放大器工作在线性区，增益", "仅由电阻之比决定——而不取决于放大器自身", "巨大且不确定的 $\\mu$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[为何使用跟随器]\\label{ex:b1:operational-amplifier:follower}", "一个戴维南电阻为 \\qty{10}{k\\ohm} 的传感器，接上", "\\qty{1}{k\\ohm} 负载后，只能输出其开路电压的 $1/11$", "（见\\cref{rem:b1:dc-circuits:loading}）。接入跟随器后，它几乎不从", "传感器汲取电流，并以零输出阻抗驱动负载，", "使满电压得以传递。跟随器是一种\\emph{阻抗", "变换器}——它还使得", "\\cref{prop:b1:filters-transfer-functions:cascade}中的级联规则严格成立。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[求和放大器与差分放大器]\\label{prop:b1:operational-amplifier:sumdiff}", "\\index{求和放大器}\\index{差分放大器}", "输入 $V_1, V_2$ 分别经 $R_1, R_2$ 接到反相节点，", "反馈电阻为 $R_f$，$V_+$ 接地：", "\\[", "V_s = -R_f\\left(\\frac{V_1}{R_1} + \\frac{V_2}{R_2}\\right)", "\\quad (\\text{求和放大器}).", "\\]", "若 $V_1$ 经 $R_1$ 接到 $V_-$（反馈为 $R_2$），$V_2$ 经", "$R_1$ 接到 $V_+$，并经 $R_2$ 将 $V_+$ 接地：", "\\[", "V_s = \\frac{R_2}{R_1}\\,(V_2 - V_1)", "\\quad (\\text{差分放大器}).", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "求和：在虚地处列节点方程，$V_1/R_1 + V_2/R_2 + V_s/R_f =", "0$。差分：$V_+ = V_2R_2/(R_1 + R_2)$（分压）；在 $V_-$ 处列节点方程：", "$(V_1 - V_-)/R_1 + (V_s - V_-)/R_2 = 0$，于是 $V_s = V_-(1 + R_2/R_1) -", "V_1R_2/R_1$；令 $V_- = V_+$ 并化简。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}